OL,3,ARussian search engine Yandex struggles
OL,4,Aafter Ukrainian strikes on data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian tech giant Yandex has said it
OL,7,Fwas struggling to maintain services
OL,8,Fafter two of its five data centres were
OL,9,Fstruck by Ukrainian drones in the past
OL,10,Ftwo days.
OL,12,FOften dubbed "Russia's Google", the
OL,13,Fcompany runs the country's most popular
OL,14,Fsearch engine, as well as a
OL,15,Ffood-ordering and taxi app used by tens
OL,16,Fof millions of people.
OL,18,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said the
OL,19,Fattacks were in response to weeks of
OL,20,FRussian strikes on Ukrainian data
OL,21,Fcentres.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
