OL,3,ARussian search engine Yandex struggles
OL,4,Aafter Ukrainian strikes on data centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth sides have stepped up attacks on
OL,7,Finfrastructure in recent months as the
OL,8,Fwar between the two drags on. Kyiv says
OL,9,Fits strikes are aimed at revenue
OL,10,Fstreams for Moscow's war machine, and
OL,11,Fthat the latest attacks could force
OL,12,FRussia to divert resources to Yandex.
